{title:BNR mortality Step 6: Publish approved outputs}

{title:What this step does}

{pstd}
Step 6 verifies the approval, manifest and checksums, then promotes the exact
approved mortality package to the authoritative public and website locations.
It does not recalculate or approve results.

{title:Before you run it}

{pstd}
Mortality Step 5 approval must exist for the same period. Do not publish if the
reviewed candidate or approval evidence has changed or an issue remains open.

{title:What to enter}

{phang}{bf:Release year and month} identify the approved Step 5 release.

{phang}{bf:Authorise replacement} should normally remain unticked. Use it only
for an authorised republication of the same release identity.

{title:After running}

{pstd}
Read the publication summary and confirm the authoritative public package,
website mirror and release ZIP. Then complete the documented website checks.

{title:Full instructions}

{pstd}
See the {browse "https://uwi-bnr.github.io/info-hub/technical/workflows/mortality/publish.html":Technical Manual: Publish approved mortality outputs}.
